{"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"@frozen","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSAlertStatus","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"There are two types of statuses:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Non-functional statuses used for informational or decorative alert messages."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"They provide context or highlight content without implying a specific state, system event, or user action.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"These alerts are not tied to UX patterns such as success, error, or warning, and may use contextual or brand-related icons to enhance recognition or storytelling."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Functional statuses communicate specific system statuses, results, or user feedback:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Each variant conveys a clear semantic meaning and must always be paired with its dedicated functional icon to ensure clarity and accessibility."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Use functional alerts to inform user about state changes, confirmations, or issues that are directly connected to system logic or user actions."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"These messages carry functional meaning and help guide user response or acknowledgment."}]}]}]}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The status of the alerts."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSAlertMessage","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" background color and its icon color are based on this status."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSInlineAlert","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" icon and text color are based on this status."}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudsalertstatus"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents"]]},"metadata":{"title":"OUDSAlertStatus","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Enumeration","modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"externalID":"s:14OUDSComponents15OUDSAlertStatusO","symbolKind":"enum","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OUDSAlertStatus","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSAlertStatus"}]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSAlertStatus"},"kind":"symbol","topicSections":[{"generated":true,"anchor":"Enumeration-Cases","title":"Enumeration Cases","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSAlertStatus\/accent(image:)","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSAlertStatus\/info","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSAlertStatus\/negative","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSAlertStatus\/neutral(image:)","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSAlertStatus\/positive","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSAlertStatus\/warning"]}],"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships"}],"references":{"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSAlertStatus/info":{"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"case","kind"